  m_text: "Read the light in the reference first: list every source, where it is, its colour and what it lights.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> How many light sources does reference 29 show, and where? Which one lights the figure and the ground around the pole?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Compare with the lot: one source is missing (look under the sign). Add it. Then open Window \u203A Rendering \u203A Light Explorer and check every light of the lot: its type, colour, intensity and shadows. The stands' spotlights are not part of the lot.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 29</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
