  m_text: 'Real-time light does not bounce. A surface is lit only when a light reaches it directly.


    <b>Predict:</b> Kiosk Light points down at the counter and the window (do station 2 first). In a real room the back wall and the ceiling would get some light back. What do they get here?


    <b>Try:</b> Add a weak light where the bounce would come from: a Spot Light by the counter, aimed up and back, Intensity about 1, Shadow Type No Shadows. Check that it does not reach outside.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 26</color></size>'
