  m_text: 'Shadows are drawn only up to the Max Distance in the URP Asset (Shadows section), 50 m in this project. Beyond it, lights still light, but nothing casts a shadow.


    <b>Predict:</b> The 11 lamps all cast shadows and stand 10 m apart. Seen from this camera, which posts will show a shadow?


    <b>Try:</b> Switch the lamps on: search the Hierarchy for Lamp Light, select all 11 and tick the Light component. Then select Assets/Settings/PC_RPAsset, set Max Distance to 120, and compare near and far. Set it back to 50: the asset is shared by the whole project.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 20, 22, 25</color></size>'
